  "prefLabel": "Jus 602.30 Staff",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 602.30 “Staff” means the department of justice employees in the unit who provide administrative support to the commission and assist claimants with their claims for compensation under Jus 600.\n\nSource. #12938, eff 12-9-19 (formerly Jus 602.26)",
